{"type": "text", "timestamp": 1791575929024, "sessionID": "ses_eddc1d024ffeUfRTC50ubFF4nW", "part": {"id": "prt_1223f072a001KwHybGELg3Ty7P", "messageID": "msg_1223eff79001m5lslCuFyeYnbo", "sessionID": "ses_eddc1d024ffeUfRTC50ubFF4nW", "type": "text", "text": "Completed the **original stage** using actual Lykoi calls. No successor or migration was created.\n\n### Admitted immutable pins\n\n| Definition | Pin |\n|---|---|\n| WindowCharge | `77878b97594fe374a02438160c41d48ba793345045832a1fc36be1c916eb8908` |\n| CallerA | `d8e6131796e6b74e4dd1be2ca9057da433ede95a74cbba1307d89f06d23acf26` |\n| CallerB | `4ee8dbb46f6afb1ba16331bb34e7dbd37e6b06ae9730083e71e4e7653a7a8398` |\n\nRetrieved WindowCharge before admitting the callers, then retrieved both closed caller definitions. Both callers validated successfully, each with **9 expanded VM nodes**.\n\nWindowCharge retains the required order: `c_start`, `c_cap`, `c_width`, then returns `end + start`. Both callers check end-of-input at the requested point.\n\n### Execution results\n\nAll output bytes below are UInt16BE.\n\n| Caller | Input hex | Observed result | Failure location / offset |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| A | `0a14` | Success: **33**, output `0021` | \u2014 |\n| A | `64c8` | Success: **303**, output `012f` | Both cap and width equality boundaries pass |\n| B | `14` | Success: **60**, output `003c` | Width equality boundary passes |\n| A | `0a13` | `WINDOW_NARROW` | `charge/\u2026/c_width`, offset 0 |\n| A | `c8c9` | `END_CAP` | `charge/\u2026/c_cap`, offset 1 |\n| A | `c8c900` | `TRAILING` | `input_end`, offset 2 |\n| B | `15` | `WINDOW_NARROW` | `charge/\u2026/c_width`, offset 0 |\n| B | `a1` | `END_CAP` | `charge/\u2026/c_cap`, offset 0 |\n| B | `a100` | `TRAILING` | `input_end`, offset 1 |\n| A | `0a` | `TRUNCATED` | `read_end`, offset 1 |\n| B | empty | `TRUNCATED` | `read_start`, offset 0 |\n\nThe simultaneous cap-and-width failures returned `END_CAP`, confirming its precedence over `WINDOW_NARROW`. Trailing-input failures occurred at `input_end`, before composition\u2014and before CallerB\u2019s arithmetic.\n\n`START_NEGATIVE` is present but unreachable through these UInt8 callers. All rejection results are preserved above; no admission, retrieval, or validation call failed.", "time": {"start": 1791575918378, "end": 1791575929022}, "metadata": {"openai": {"itemId": "msg_0177cafc6a1e7fc2016ac9476f270887d094bb76cc28b8e97a", "phase": "final_answer"}}}}
